<title>UK: BayerHypo sets 500 mln Austrian Schilling bond.</title>
<headline>BayerHypo sets 500 mln Austrian Schilling bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Investmentbank Austria.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN ATS   COUPON     *7.0	MATURITY    26.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    VIENNA    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/A+    DENOMS (M) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    U.K.	HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST FIVE YEARS, THEN 15.50 PCT LESS TWO TIMES</p>
<p>		12-MONTH VIBOR ON A BOND BASIS</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
